  m_text: "Cards are your main actions during battle.\n\n\u2022 Every card requires
    a certain amount \nof energy.\n\u2022 Energy returns at the start of each turn.\n\u2022
    Attack cards deal damage, while defensive cards provide block.\n\u2022 Some cards
    become stronger when combined with other effects.\n\u2022 Earn new cards from
    chests, battles \nand shops.\n\n"
